Messages appear inside both players' games. Shown here: a two-way chat exchange in the Enclave courtyard, sent through the harness's console commands. [url=https://christophervr.github.io/kotor-coop/media/showcase/in-game-chat.mp4]Watch or pause this clip.[/url]

[size=5][b]Leave and return[/b][/size]
[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChristopherVR/kotor-coop/main/site/media/showcase/leave-and-rejoin.gif[/img]
